 blob of paint, a tube or the palette, press it to the canvas and paint. No buttons, no menus. Press harder for a wider stroke, dip into another colour and the two mix, rinse in the jar or wipe it on the rag.\n\nFIVE EASELS, FIVE BRUSHES\nTwo in the window light, a big canvas and another in the gallery room, and a plein-air easel on the balcony facing your view. Twelve artist colours at each, brushes from a fine detail tip to a 40 mm flat.\n\nSPRAY PAINT\nEight cans on a cart by the balcony door. Close for a sharp line, back off for a soft fog.\n\nKEEP WHAT YOU MAKE\nEvery canvas saves itself. Touch SAVE on the easel tray and the painting goes to your headset gallery, ready to share to your phone. Press Y for a photo of whatever you are looking at.\n\nOil paintings on the walls, a worktable of tubes and brushes, a vintage radio playing jazz, and the sea through the door.\n\nDeveloped and published by Citiview Studios.", "short_description": "The painting studio from Art Studio, with the view in your hands. Step onto the balcony, touch the arrows on the steel console, and the world outside the glass changes - a Miami sunset, a sky on fire, a quiet beach at first light, Venice, a city at dusk, a night lagoon, a neon harbour. The light in the studio changes with it. Five easels, twelve colours, five brushes and eight spray cans, and everything you paint saves itself."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://citiview-games.pages.dev/artstudio2/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Citiview Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://citiview-games.pages.dev/artstudio2/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "